body:
After some further investigation it does look like the issue also occurs while there is a default defined in the destructuring of props but is missing from the defined propTypes of the component.

The following looks to throw an error as it is trying to assign the default value for `bar` to an unassigned propType

```
const MyComponent= ({
    foo= true,
    bar = false,
}) => <div> Hi</div>

MyComponent.propTypes = {
    foo: PropTypes.bool,
}
```
